Run the following linting tool for specified files/folders:
```
lint <file_or_folder>
```
Fix the errors pointed out by the linters.
While fixing errors make sure to follow [python-rules.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/python-rules.mdc)

Remove redundant comments. Only leave comments based on following criteria:
* Comment describes complex algorithms or non-obvious code. 
* Comment explains "why" rather than "what". i.e. the comment provides reasoning behind the code
* TODO comments should be left in the code unless the TODO comment is implemented already or no longer relevant
